# Dr. Iris Kwan, EBI chief biologist, New World Program. Lore NPC: says the quiet part out loud.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: (She doesn't look up from the tablet.) Visitors go through the front desk. You're not at the front desk.
#
o_text: What is the New World Program?
o_id: kwan_program
o_goto: Program
#
o_text: The south gate. Four hundred bodies.
o_id: kwan_gate
o_goto: Gate
#
o_text: Leaving.
o_id: kwan_leave
o_goto: End

name: Program
npc: A smaller humanity that fits its planet. Fewer mouths, better genes, no chips for anyone to hijack.
+ Nature prunes. We simply stopped pretending we're exempt.
#
o_text: And who decides what gets pruned?
o_id: kwan_who
o_goto: Who
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: program_back
o_goto: Default

name: Who
npc: (Now she looks up.) People who can read a genome. Not people who can read a ticket.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: who_back
o_goto: Default

name: Gate
npc: A sanitation event. The report is public, if you can find it. (She can't hide a small smile.) You can't.
#
o_text: (Back)
o_id: gate_back
o_goto: Default

name: End
npc: (She goes back to the tablet.)
effect: EndConversation
